# Knight of Wundagore: "Whenever you put a +1/+1 counter on another creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. This ability triggers
# only once each turn." On turn 3 Bot1 puts a counter on its Grizzly Bears with a Go Nuts!: the Knight gets one (3/2); a second Go Nuts! on
# the Bears the same turn gives it none (4/4 Bears, Knight still 3/2). Bot2's Go Nuts! on the Bears on turn 4 (the Bears 5/5) is not "you"
# putting it, so the Knight stays 3/2. On turn 5 Bot1's Go Nuts! on the Knight itself is not "another creature": it takes the counter
# it was given (4/3) and no more.

